[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17770.55, "timestamp": "04:56:10", "text": "这？现在只是这一点，我不能再添加一个了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17773.47, "timestamp": "04:56:13", "text": "这里加了混响。我相信我应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17782.32, "timestamp": "04:56:22", "text": "发送。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17801.47, "timestamp": "04:56:41", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17806.868, "timestamp": "04:56:46", "text": "嗯，对。接下来，呃，我需要一个配菜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17808.99, "timestamp": "04:56:48", "text": "链。正确的。边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17812.39, "timestamp": "04:56:52", "text": "链。侧链。我们那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17814.43, "timestamp": "04:56:54", "text": "再次？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17816.34, "timestamp": "04:56:56", "text": "压缩机。穿上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17817.788, "timestamp": "04:56:57", "text": "[音乐]"}]